  cas: Compare current parent and fence\nActual source / account / floor join\nOne determining append {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
  alias: Reject stale queued commands\nRecover the same original outcome\nNo duplicate tail admission {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
  hold: Keep unknown reservation intact\nNo refund from a missing projection\nFinal sending has its own gates {
